<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STABLE AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STABLE AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates were steady at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday. The three-month rate was steady at 3.09 percent.</p>
<p>				  November 7 fix	November 6 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		   3.02 pct		3.02 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		   3.05 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		   3.09 pct		3.09 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		   3.21 pct		3.21 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		   3.35 pct		3.34 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		  3.49 pct		3.48 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
